  "description": "The text 'no little asian' is overlaid on the image of a group of East Asian individuals enjoying street food. This text is a racist trope that implies Asian men are small or weak, and it is mapped onto the visual group to dehumanize them by associating them with a derogatory stereotype. The visual group, which appears happy and normal, is contrasted with the hateful text to reinforce the stereotype.",
